{"id":3873,"date":"2026-03-30T18:11:54","date_gmt":"2026-03-30T18:11:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/?p=3873"},"modified":"2026-03-30T18:22:11","modified_gmt":"2026-03-30T18:22:11","slug":"dubai-hills-villa-13-dubai","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/dubai-hills-villa-13-dubai\/","title":{"rendered":"Dubai Hills Villa 13 \u2013 Dubai"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Project Overview<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CDE Engineering Services was engaged by SPD Interior &amp; Landscaping Contracting to carry out a structural assessment and develop strengthening design solutions for an existing villa located in Dubai Hills.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The project involved evaluating the impact of proposed architectural modifications, including the addition of a new steel roof structure and changes at basement and roof levels, on the existing structural system.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Client<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SPD Interior &amp; Landscaping Contracting<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Location<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dubai, UAE<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Client Challenge<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The client planned multiple architectural modifications, including the addition of new structural elements such as a steel roof, jacuzzi, and technical rooms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These changes introduced additional loads and required careful assessment to ensure that the existing structural system, including slabs and foundations, could safely accommodate the modifications without compromising stability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Scope of Work<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3873_0e61dd-ef:not(.this-stops-third-p